      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What benefit would this have other than incentivizing people to pay for vrc+? The world creator isn't making any profit off people paying for vrc+, and to me, it feels like setting up the framework to further segregate users either by locking world features behind it, or even potentially working in reverse, and taking world features away from subscribers?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
