      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63e336c15c09c650b417b83a|full_name} (the creator of this feature request) mentioned how they plan on using this feature:\n\n> grant additional benefits or perks to people who support VRChat Directly\n\nI appreciate that world creators want to support VRChat this way! Without the support of users and creators, VRChat wouldn't exist. Ultimately, it's up to world creators how to use this feature.\n\nWorld creators already have the ability to paywall features with the Creator Economy. From what I've seen, they do so responsibly, and it has allowed them to create more (and better) worlds. Though I remember hearing similar concerns when we first announced the CE.\n\nBy \"taking world features away from subscribers\", are you referring to VRChat+ subscribers, or to something else?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
