      "value": "@{5d6745ff863fcc6ee6ee4176|full_name} at the end of the day, if someone doesn't want to pay for something then they won't. \n\nWorld creators are only going to implement these things if they think they are going to work and a lot of these world creators are part of the same community you're part of.\n\nIf you don't like going to worlds or spaces that require heavy monetization and you feel like you have no value buying it, then all you have to do is not pay for it. \n\nIf enough people agree with this perspective than those features and those worlds will not make money and the world creators will realize this. \n\nThis problem solves itself.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
